What is an Automotive Convertible Top?

An Automotive Convertible Top is a retractable roof system consisting of an articulated frame covered with a textile-based fabric, an evolution from the classic open carriage that has now become the most common form. A less common detachable hardtop provides a more weatherproof and secure alternative. As technology improved, a retractable hardtop that removes and stows its own rigid roof in the trunk has appeared, increasingly becoming the most popular form due to its superior weatherproofing, security, and perceived premium quality.

